  "excerpt_en": "High-gamma contracts react violently to small underlying moves—high octane for short-term trades, dangerous for beginners.",
  "body_en": "<!-- ===== OptionsAji 博客片段：高 GAMMA 榜使用说明 ===== -->\n<style>\n  .aji-guide{--bg:#f5f2f0;--ink:#151617;--gold:#c9a227;--card:#fffdfb;--line:#e7e1d8;--muted:#6f6a63;--soft:#c9c2b6;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;line-height:1.75;font-size:16px;padding:4px}\n  .aji-guide h2{font-size:22px;margin:0 0 10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.2px}\n  .aji-guide h3{font-size:18px;margin:26px 0 8px;font-weight:700}\n  .aji-guide p{margin:10px 0}.aji-guide .lead{font-size:17px}\n  .aji-guide .accent{color:var(--gold);font-weight:700}\n  .aji-guide .chart-card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:20px 22px;margin:22px 0;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(21,22,23,.05)}\n  .aji-guide .chart-note{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 14px}\n  .aji-guide canvas{max-width:100%}\n  .aji-guide .analogy{border-left:4px solid var(--gold);background:rgba(201,162,39,.07);padding:12px 16px;border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;margin:16px 0}\n  .aji-guide .formula{background:#151617;color:#f5f2f0;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;overflow-x:auto}\n  .aji-guide .formula b{color:var(--gold)}\n  .aji-guide .data-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:14px 0;font-size:14.5px;overflow:hidden;border-radius:10px}\n  .aji-guide .data-table th{background:var(--ink);color:#f5f2f0;text-align:left;padding:11px 14px;font-weight:600}\n  .aji-guide .data-table td{padding:11px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:top}\n  .aji-guide .data-table tr:nth-child(even) td{background:rgba(201,162,39,.035)}\n  .aji-guide .data-table .col{font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap}\n  .aji-guide .tag{display:inline-block;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:20px}\n  .aji-guide .tag-core{background:var(--gold);color:#fff}.aji-guide .tag-base{background:var(--soft);color:var(--ink)}\n  .aji-guide .disclaimer{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:26px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}\n  .aji-guide .cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--gold);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;padding:11px 20px;border-radius:10px;font-size:15px;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(201,162,39,.3);transition:background .15s}\n  .aji-guide .cta:hover{background:#b8911f}\n  .aji-guide .cta-row{margin:16px 0 4px}\n  .aji-guide .cta-bottom{background:rgba(201,162,39,.08);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:18px 20px;margin:24px 0 8px;text-align:center}\n  .aji-guide .cta-bottom p{margin:0 0 10px;font-weight:700}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"aji-guide\">\n  <h2>Understanding the High Gamma Board: Where Delta Moves Fastest</h2>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Gamma measures <span class=\"accent\">how fast delta changes</span>. High-gamma contracts swing hard on small underlying moves—high octane for short-term trades, dangerous for beginners.</p>\n  <div class=\"cta-row\"><a class=\"cta\" href=\"https://www.options-aji.com/options/high-gamma\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">📊 Open live High Gamma board →</a></div>\n  <h3>1. Delta and Gamma: Driving Analogy</h3>\n  <div class=\"analogy\"><p style=\"margin:4px 0\"><b>Delta = speed</b>: how much option price moves per $1 in the stock.</p><p style=\"margin:4px 0\"><b>Gamma = throttle sensitivity</b>: how fast delta itself changes. High gamma = direction exposure ramps quickly.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"formula\">New Delta ≈ Old Delta + <b>Gamma</b> × underlying move<br><b>Ex</b>: Delta 0.40, Gamma 0.08, stock +$2 → new Delta ≈ <b>0.56</b></div>\n  <div class=\"chart-card\"><h2 style=\"font-size:18px\">Gamma by Strike: Peaks at ATM (example)</h2><p class=\"chart-note\">Spot $100. Gamma peaks near the money. Rendered with Chart.js via jsDelivr CDN only.</p><canvas id=\"gmCurve\" width=\"640\" height=\"300\" aria-label=\"Gamma curve\"></canvas></div>\n  <h3>2. Closer to Expiry, Gamma Explodes</h3>\n  <p><span class=\"accent\">Near expiry, ATM gamma spikes</span>—why 0DTE options whip. High gamma also means <b>high theta</b>: time decay is brutal.</p>\n  <div class=\"chart-card\"><h2 style=\"font-size:18px\">Near vs Far Expiry</h2><p class=\"chart-note\">Gold = 3 DTE; gray = 45 DTE. Same ATM, near month is far more sensitive.</p><canvas id=\"gmDte\" width=\"640\" height=\"280\" aria-label=\"Gamma by DTE\"></canvas></div>\n  <h3>3. Column Guide</h3>\n  <table class=\"data-table\"><thead><tr><th>Column</th><th>Meaning</th><th>How to use</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">#</td><td>Rank by gamma.</td><td>Fastest delta change.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">Contract</td><td>Symbol, expiry, strike, side.</td><td>Often near-term, near ATM.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">Gamma <span class=\"tag tag-core\">Core</span></td><td>Rate of delta change.</td><td>High = explosive P&amp;L.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">Delta</td><td>Direction exposure.</td><td>Current and potential lean.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">DTE</td><td>Days to expiry.</td><td><span class=\"accent\">Lower DTE → higher gamma</span>.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">Dist to ATM</td><td>Strike vs spot.</td><td>Closer = higher gamma.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">IV <span class=\"tag tag-base\">Aux</span></td><td>Implied vol.</td><td>Shapes gamma profile.</td></tr>\n  </tbody></table>\n  <h3>4. Three Reminders</h3>\n  <p><b>1. Buyers love gamma; naked sellers fear it.</b><br><b>2. High gamma ↔ high theta.</b><br><b>3. Short-term tool—not a hold overnight play.</b></p>\n  <div class=\"cta-bottom\"><p>Ready to explore? See today's live data 👇</p><a class=\"cta\" href=\"https://www.options-aji.com/options/high-gamma\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">📊 Open live High Gamma board →</a></div><p class=\"disclaimer\">Data may be delayed ~15 minutes. For research only—not investment advice. Options trading involves substantial risk of loss. © OptionsAji</p>\n\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.4.1/dist/chart.umd.min.js\"></script>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  if(typeof Chart==='undefined')return;\n  var GOLD='#c9a227',GRAY='#c9c2b6',INK='#151617';\n  var strikes=['80','85','90','95','100','105','110','115','120'];\n  var g=[0.005,0.012,0.028,0.055,0.078,0.055,0.028,0.012,0.005];\n  var c1=document.getElementById('gmCurve');\n  if(c1){new Chart(c1,{type:'line',data:{labels:strikes,datasets:[{label:'Gamma',data:g,borderColor:GOLD,backgroundColor:'rgba(201,162,39,.14)',fill:true,tension:.4,pointRadius:0}]},\n    options:{responsive:true,plugins:{legend:{display:false},tooltip:{callbacks:{title:function(t){return 'Strike $'+t[0].label;},label:function(i){return 'Gamma '+i.parsed.y.toFixed(3);}}}},\n    scales:{x:{title:{display:true,text:'Strike (spot $100)',color:INK},ticks:{color:INK},grid:{display:false}},y:{ticks:{color:INK},grid:{color:'rgba(21,22,23,.06)'}}}}});}\n  var near=[0.004,0.010,0.024,0.060,0.140,0.060,0.024,0.010,0.004];\n  var far=[0.010,0.018,0.028,0.038,0.045,0.038,0.028,0.018,0.010];\n  var c2=document.getElementById('gmDte');\n  if(c2){new Chart(c2,{type:'line',data:{labels:strikes,datasets:[\n      {label:'Near (3 DTE)',data:near,borderColor:GOLD,tension:.4,pointRadius:0,borderWidth:2.5},\n      {label:'Far (45 DTE)',data:far,borderColor:GRAY,tension:.4,pointRadius:0,borderWidth:2.5}]},\n    options:{responsive:true,plugins:{legend:{labels:{color:INK,font:{size:13}}}},\n    scales:{x:{title:{display:true,text:'Strike (spot $100)',color:INK},ticks:{color:INK},grid:{display:false}},y:{ticks:{color:INK},grid:{color:'rgba(21,22,23,.06)'}}}}});}\n})();\n</script>\n<!-- ===== /片段结束 ===== -->"
}
